The Userland library for ALSA compressed API "tinycompress" is available
in dual BSD and LGPL license. This development version 0.0.1 contains
support for playback of compressed formats.
This library also includes a command line player which support mp3 files
only.

The library is hosted at: git://git.alsa-project.org/tinycompress.git

Currently it includes the Makefile for Android only.

Comments, question, criticism and patches are welcome!

